{
  "description": "Replaced the 41 graph archives of the java_points_to and c_alias_analysis categories in place at 5.0.0/graph/ with copies that add the optimized WCNF grammars of arXiv:2401.11029 (optimization 5, Figs 1(b) and 2(b)) to their grammar/ directory. Every other member is byte-identical to the previous archive (verified per member). The java_points_to archives come in two label conventions: the 7 indexed-template archives (gson, mockito, commons_io, commons_lang3, junit5, guava, jackson) carry the indexed variant, the 14 bare-family-form archives (sunflow, lusearch, luindex, avrora, eclipse, h2, pmd, xalan, batik, fop, tomcat, jython, tradebeans, tradesoap) carry the same productions without the _i suffix; both are stored under the file name java_points_to_muravev2024.cnf. Equivalence of original and optimized grammars was verified with FastMatrixCFPQ on 10 small graphs (see tasks/detailed_plan.md, task 56).",
